:: Act3

\> You are finally in the final stretch. 

\> The next action you take determines your ending.

\>> [[[I should place the gem on the pedestal|place_gem]]]

\>> [[[What if I try to break it?|break_gem]]]

\>> [[[I've had enough. I give up on all this|ignore_gem]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: place_gem

\> You're finally free. Go back home. 

/* Another ending if all easter eggs are collected */
/**********************/


/**********************/
:: break_gem

\> You have chosen to break this. You will regret this. You should have made better choices.

/* "Bad" ending. Music goes wonky, droning noise increases, single bang on door, cut to black */
/**********************/


/**********************/
:: ignore_gem


\> You decided to give up after all this. Following your decision, nothing will happen over the next eternity.

/* "Null" ending. Spend eternity watching the eons pass. */
/**********************/
